In the `Insert` method, the element is inserted at the given index `index` and all existing elements at or after this index are shifted one position to the right, which ensures the first occurrence of `x` is at position `i+1` after the insertion. Therefore, the last occurrence of `x` is at position `i` after the insertion. 

