```cs
public virtual void Insert(int index, Object value)
{
    //...
    if (index < _size)
    {
        Array.Copy(_items, index, _items, index + 1, _size - index);
    }
    _items[index] = value;
    _size++;
    _version++;

    // @@@ index where x is inserted should be between the first and last occurances of x in the array after the insertion
    Debug.Assert(_items[_size + index] == value);
}
```
The line `Debug.Assert(_items[_size + index] == value);` is the assert statement that checks the inserted position and the value being inserted.
